---
description: Testing patterns and structure
globs: ["**/*.test.ts", "**/*.spec.ts", "**/*.test.tsx", "**/*.spec.tsx", "**/__tests__/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- Describe blocks map 1:1 to module/function names
- Mock external dependencies, never real network calls
- Test happy path + at least one error case per function
- Use data-testid attributes for DOM queries
